\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {134}{\ignorespaces Structural Bayesian learning for LPN. The uniform prior supplies the neutral \(2^{-n}\) contact. Every noisy reveal retains its source and SDPI coefficient. Likelihood, normalization, posterior approximation, acquisition, and deployment are deterministic charged descendants; the actionable next-test gain is bounded by the five source charges and the same-record learning and dynamical certificates.}}{661}{figure.134}\protected@file@percent }
